ved in  eldon ring the children's tv icon has  been modded into all sorts of games and  now he can appear right in the middle of  the lance between the tree's sentinel  thomas mod replaces the optional limb  grave boss with thomas's smiling face or  at least the lower half of the sentinel  the result is something like a centaur  if centaurs had happy trains as their  bottom halves you can find the mod on  nexus mods if you want to try it out for  yourself but as always use the mods at  your own risk and in other elden ring  news less than a month after it was  released the game has sold over 12  million units so far according to bandai  namco that number accounts for both  digital sales and shipments of physical  additions to retailers but not  necessarily yet sold through to  consumers on playstation 4 and  playstation 5 elden ring was the  playstation store's most downloaded game  in february alone and now hit the  comment section and let me know why do  you like scary things why why just sell  me on it  why
 

